1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,610
W: Okay, let me see if I have everything straight here.

2
00:00:02,995 --> 00:00:13,530
Your flight is due to arrive next Tuesday on June 20 at 4:50 p. m. You will spend one night at the Hilton Hills and be on the 11 o'clock flight out to London, right?

3
00:00:13,930 --> 00:00:14,470
M: That's correct.

4
00:00:15,230 --> 00:00:25,150
I will spend a night in Paris to meet with Mr. Chretien the first thing Wednesday morning to settle a couple of things before I set out to London to close a deal with Mr. Charles Connery.

5
00:00:25,670 --> 00:00:29,370
I need you to make sure you have all the documents ready for me when I get there.

6
00:00:29,950 --> 00:00:30,890
W: No problem.

7
00:00:31,370 --> 00:00:39,770
I've also called Mr. Chretien and told him that you would be coming to see him, and he said he would have all the necessary documents ready for you as well.

8
00:00:40,125 --> 00:00:40,590
M: That's great.

9
00:00:41,110 --> 00:00:43,590
I have a gut feeling that I am going to land this contract.

10
00:00:44,390 --> 00:00:45,590
I feel very good about it.
